@title 3D vents: a device within half a kelvin of its limit says so on the label and in the panel line
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The hot cabinet with the filter fan and its grille already in, and T1 limit set (by qa/fixtures/make_vents_fixtures.py) so the run ends within half a kelvin of it. The label and the panel line say "at its limit" instead of "0 K under". Both are drawn text the harness cannot read, so the picture is the evidence; the finished run is checked.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-vents-at-limit.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 170
expect_not "A run is going on the openings"
shot 01-at-its-limit
check_layout
check_blank 01-at-its-limit
